Package: spatiotemporal
Maintainer: Emanuele Cordano <emanuele.cordano@gmail.com>
License: EUPL (>= 1.2)
Title: Tools to handle spatiotemporal data organized in Time Series
Type: Package
Authors@R: c(person(given="Emanuele",family="Cordano",role = c("aut","cre"),email = "emanuele.cordano@gmail.com",comment = c(ORCID=  "0000-0002-3508-5898")))
Description: A spatiotemporal database schema. It has been created to handle weather data from weather stations. The database can be an R object (a list of tables, see db) or a PostgreSQL/PostGIS/TimescaleDB database accessed through DBI.
